    "created_at": "2016-06-27T18:03:20Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-27T18:03:20Z",
    "body": "WebKit prefers to leave the \"User agents may invoke the \"kill a worker\" processing model on a worker at any time\" language.\n\nAs Domenic mentioned, \"user experience reasons\" is one class of reasons why we might. There might be others.\n",
