    "body": "@domenic if you could review this that'd be appreciated. I wanted to use the GitHub UI, but with the new review suggestions feature from GitHub it appears that's broken.\r\n\r\nI'll promise less about GC in the eventual commit message, though other than network/storage I/O I don't think we make GC observable (or intend to, anyway). It seems like service workers is poking a bunch of holes though that they should maybe fix.",
