    "body": "I found https://lists.w3.org/Archives/Public/public-html-diffs/2008Dec/0048.html after some digging which led @domenic and I to conclude that this is probably safe to merge. The algorithms used to be very different and got closer over time as well.\r\n\r\nThere is probably some further lifetime cleanup to be done, in particular around MessagePort management.\r\n\r\nI'll merge this tomorrow if nobody has raised further concerns by then.",
